            <ArticleTitle>Persistent pain in the elderly.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>43-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Persistent pain is a challenging problem in the elderly and is not a normal process in aging. Successful management of persistent pain can be achieved through comprehensive assessment, use of routine pain medication and careful monitoring of medical functional status.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
